{"key":"moment:3618561","id":"3618561","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"348627","name":"渣丸子","avatar":"6bff8965b006724a4d9551ef"},"time":"2023-08-12","text":"[emot=acfun,2445/]今天跑去看了孤注一掷\n电影很一般吧，本来想做视频的，后来想想算了，就动态分享一下观后感吧，这个片子定位不清不楚，剧情太散，什么都想表现，导致没有主心骨\n而且一些剧情细节太魔幻，比如王大陆的支线剧情里好多细节看着不像国内能出现的情况，而且感觉这个片子有比较重的宣传任务，是那种我前头演一段，后面台词还带总结的，有很多角色总是跳出剧情，以一种很高的视角进行总结，所以剧情也很啰嗦\n因此总结是2流电影，更像电视剧的叙事节奏，反诈宣传做的很细致，但表达太机械教条","title":"","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":42,"likeCount":117,"bananaCount":52,"shareCount":1},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/3618561","archivedComments":40,"archivedRoots":19,"commentPages":["comments/3618561/all/1.json"],"hotPages":["comments/3618561/hot/1.json"],"threads":{"792413546":{"pages":["comments/3618561/threads/792413546/1.json"],"savedReplies":3,"reportedReplies":3,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"792413546","root":"792413546","user":{"id":"731290","name":"听风的优","avatar":"c6bb20a041bcd51b0f486515"},"text":"一个名下房产能抵押将近800万的…为了给女朋友买个5万的礼物去赌…\n还有最后男主就是被逼迫的不判刑…别人就不是被逼迫的？吃馒头还是有用啊…","time":1691883465386,"floor":16,"likes":3,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":3,"hot":false}},"792408260":{"pages":["comments/3618561/threads/792408260/1.json"],"savedReplies":2,"reportedReplies":2,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"792408260","root":"792408260","user":{"id":"12773458","name":"通利福尼亚吴彦祖","avatar":"d4ff9c8aabf77b9aafaf61e6"},"text":"感觉人物都特别脸谱化，内里没有驱动力[emot=acfun,1793/]","time":1691856303630,"floor":12,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":false}},"792407226":{"pages":["comments/3618561/threads/792407226/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"792407226","root":"792407226","user":{"id":"30656494","name":"何欢何来","avatar":"65abef69206f9ae216c07d32"},"text":"张艺兴演得咋样？和《人生大事》里面的朱一龙比如何？","time":1691854358734,"floor":11,"likes":0,"isUp":false